@haoxuanjng-lang/kaggle-solutions-skills README · 🤖 Multi-agent research：```text
$kaggle-solutions-skills Use multiple agents to analyze OTTO retrieval and ranking, review validation leakage, and propose minimal transfer experiments. Keep missing target metrics unknown.
```

@haoxuanjng-lang/kaggle-solutions-skills README · 📚 Knowledge coverage：Some read material covers only part of a method or points to code. Another 125 competitions have no solution links. These counts describe archive and research coverage. Access, reading, and reproduction status for the 4,708 URLs still require individual verification. This project has not run these winning training pipelines.

